# FIPS Peer Allow List
#
# Optional list of explicitly allowed peer npubs.
#
# Evaluation order:
#   1. If a peer matches an entry here, it is permitted.
#   2. Otherwise peers.deny is checked.
#   3. Otherwise the peer is permitted (default-open).
#
# Format:
#   - One entry per line
#   - Use ALL to match any peer
#   - Lines starting with # are comments
#
# Example:
#   npub10yffd020a4ag8zcy75f9pruq3rnghvvhd5hphl9s62zgp35s560qrksp9u
